    desc: 'Krog po javnih cestah okoli Hakoneja na Japonskem: iz toplic v Yumotu po državni cesti 1 v hrib ob reki Hayakawi skozi Tōnosawo, mimo cikcakov gorske železnice, skozi Miyanoshito in Kowakidani do vrha ceste (874 m), mimo jezera Shōjin do Moto-Hakoneja nad jezerom Ashi, nato po stari poti Tōkaidō (cesta 732) skozi gozd, Sedem ovinkov in vas Hatajuku nazaj v Yumoto. En krog, 26,8 km, 25 serpentin, 100 avtov z letečim štartom.',
    en: { name: 'Hakone, Japan', desc: 'A lap of the public roads round Hakone in Japan: from the hot springs of Yumoto up national road 1 along the Hayakawa river through Tōnosawa, past the zigzags of the mountain railway, through Miyanoshita and Kowakidani to the top of the road (874 m), past Lake Shōjin to Moto-Hakone above Lake Ashi, then down the old Tōkaidō road (road 732) through the forest, the Seven Bends and the village of Hatajuku back to Yumoto. One lap of 26.8 km, 25 hairpins, 100 cars from a flying start.' },
